{
  "id": "04-void-black-fill",
  "title": "Brand black fill (Void)",
  "covers": "Lolly Demo's Void is #000000 with a declared build of 0/0/0/100 and no spot ink, so black is process black: a solid #000000 fill is a Void swatch hit and prints on the K plate only, whether the RIP keeps spots or flattens them. Small black text stays sharp when the plates slip.",
